2024-11-25 09:52:30,919 [INFO] Cleaned response: To initiate a grade appeal at Loyalist College, follow these steps:

1. Connect with your instructor first to resolve any concern informally.
2. If the concern cannot be resolved through the informal process, you may choose to pursue a formal Academic Appeal.
3. You can initiate an appeal at any time during the semester but must submit it within five working days from the issuance of the final grades.

To start the formal grade appeal process:

1. Complete and submit the Academic Appeal form - Academic-Appeal-Form Stage 1A.
2. Submit the form to your faculty who taught your course, including the Academic Department (academics@tbcollege.com).

Please note that you must familiarize yourself with the Grade Appeal Process - Academic Appeal Procedure.

Additionally, if you're requesting a supplemental opportunity, you must submit it within seven calendar days of the issuance of the final grades.
