2024-12-03 11:42:39,564 [INFO] Cleaned response: To update your mailing address in Banner, follow these steps:

1. Log in to the myLoyalist portal and select Students on the red menu bar then My Information on the blue menu bar.
2. Click on the Phone/Address icon.
3. Click Personal Information.
4. Update Address(es) and Phone(s). Make sure to update your mailing address.

That's it! If you have any issues, please contact servicedesk@loyalistcollege.com.
