2024-12-03 11:43:06,763 [INFO] Cleaned response: CONTEXT: Update your Mailing Address & Social Insurance Number (SIN)

To update your mailing address, you can follow these steps:

1. Go to myApps and click on "Student Account" or "myFees".
2. Click on "Update Your Information" or a similar section.
3. Select "Mailing Address" as the field to be updated.
4. Enter your new mailing address.
5. Save the changes.

Additionally, you may also need to update your social insurance number (SIN) if it has changed.

For more information on updating your SIN, please refer to Section C of the provided document or contact International Accounts at internationalaccounts@loyalistcollege.com.
